<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>5809 Sayılı EHK – Yetkinlik Sınavı (22 Soru)</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0a0c10;
    --surface: #111318;
    --card: #181c24;
    --border: #252b38;
    --accent: #00d4ff;
    --accent2: #ff6b2b;
    --correct: #00e676;
    --wrong: #ff3d57;
    --text: #e8eaf0;
    --muted: #7a8299;
    --gold: #ffd54f;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* SCANLINE OVERLAY */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(0,0,0,.08) 2px, rgba(0,0,0,.08) 4px);
    pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999;
  }

  /* GRID BG */
  body::after {
    content: '';
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(0,212,255,.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,212,255,.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 48px 48px;
    pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
  }

  /* ── SCREENS ── */
  .screen { display: none; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .screen.active { display: flex; }

  /* ── INTRO ── */
  #intro {
    min-height: 100vh;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(0,212,255,.1);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    padding: 6px 18px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(56px, 10vw, 110px);
    line-height: .9;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, var(--accent) 60%, var(--accent2) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 36px);
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .intro-stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .stat-box {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 20px 28px;
    text-align: center;
    min-width: 120px;
  }

  .stat-num {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive;
    font-size: 42px;
    color: var(--accent);
    display: block;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .btn-start {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    padding: 18px 48px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
  }

  .btn-start::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.2);
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    transition: transform .3s;
  }

  .btn-start:hover::before { transform: translateX(0); }
  .btn-start:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,212,255,.4); }

  /* ── QUIZ SCREEN ── */
  #quiz {
    min-height: 100vh;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 0;
  }

  /* TOP BAR */
  .topbar {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(10,12,16,.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 14px 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .q-counter {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .q-counter span { color: var(--accent); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; }

  .progress-bar-wrap {
    flex: 1; max-width: 400px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--border);
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .progress-bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
    transition: width .5s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
  }

  .score-pill {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    background: rgba(0,230,118,.1);
    border: 1px solid var(--correct);
    color: var(--correct);
    padding: 6px 16px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* QUESTION CARD */
  .q-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 48px auto;
    padding: 0 24px 80px;
  }

  .q-type-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    background: rgba(255,107,43,.1);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent2);
    color: var(--accent2);
  }

  .q-number {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive;
    font-size: 72px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: rgba(0,212,255,.15);
    position: absolute;
    right: 0; top: -10px;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .q-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 36px 40px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    animation: slideIn .4s ease;
  }

  .q-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
  }

  @keyframes slideIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .q-text {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .q-text strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* CHOICES */
  .choices { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }

  .choice {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all .2s;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .choice::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity .2s;
  }

  .choice:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .choice:hover::after { opacity: .06; }

  .choice-letter {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--muted);
    min-width: 24px;
    margin-top: 1px;
    transition: color .2s;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }

  .choice-text {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    transition: color .2s;
  }

  /* States */
  .choice.selected { border-color: var(--accent); background: rgba(0,212,255,.08); }
  .choice.selected .choice-letter { color: var(--accent); }

  .choice.correct {
    border-color: var(--correct) !important;
    background: rgba(0,230,118,.1) !important;
  }
  .choice.correct .choice-letter,
  .choice.correct .choice-text { color: var(--correct); }

  .choice.wrong {
    border-color: var(--wrong) !important;
    background: rgba(255,61,87,.1) !important;
  }
  .choice.wrong .choice-letter,
  .choice.wrong .choice-text { color: var(--wrong); }

  .choice.disabled { cursor: default; pointer-events: none; }
  .choice.disabled:hover::after { opacity: 0; }
  .choice.dimmed { opacity: .35; }

  .choice-icon {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 18px;
    min-width: 20px;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }

  /* FEEDBACK */
  .feedback-box {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--correct);
    background: rgba(0,230,118,.06);
    animation: fadeUp .3s ease;
    display: none;
  }

  .feedback-box.show { display: block; }
  .feedback-box.wrong { border-left-color: var(--wrong); background: rgba(255,61,87,.06); }

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .feedback-title {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--correct);
  }
  .feedback-box.wrong .feedback-title { color: var(--wrong); }

  .feedback-text { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); }

  /* NEXT BTN */
  .btn-next {
    display: none;
    margin-top: 28px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    padding: 14px 36px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: all .2s;
  }
  .btn-next:hover { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); }
  .btn-next.show { display: inline-block; animation: fadeUp .3s ease; }

  /* SECTION HEADER */
  .section-header {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  /* ── RESULTS ── */
  #results {
    min-height: 100vh;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 60px 24px;
  }

  .result-card {
    max-width: 760px;
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 60px 48px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .result-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(0,212,255,.08), transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .result-grade {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive;
    font-size: 120px;
    line-height: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .result-label {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .result-message {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .result-sub {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .result-bars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .rbar-item { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px 24px; }
  .rbar-label { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .rbar-val { font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive; font-size: 40px; }
  .rbar-val.green { color: var(--correct); }
  .rbar-val.red { color: var(--wrong); }
  .rbar-val.blue { color: var(--accent); }
  .rbar-val.gold { color: var(--gold); }

  .btn-retry {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--muted);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    padding: 14px 36px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: all .2s;
    margin-right: 16px;
  }
  .btn-retry:hover { border-color: var(--text); color: var(--text); }

  .btn-review {
    background: var(--accent2);
    border: none;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    padding: 14px 36px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: all .2s;
  }
  .btn-review:hover { opacity: .85; }

  /* ANSWER KEY */
  #answer-key {
    display: none;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    max-width: 860px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto 80px;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  #answer-key.show { display: block; }

  .ak-title {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive;
    font-size: 48px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 60px 0 32px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .ak-item {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 28px 32px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--border);
  }
  .ak-item.ak-correct { border-left-color: var(--correct); }
  .ak-item.ak-wrong   { border-left-color: var(--wrong); }

  .ak-q-num { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .ak-q-text { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .ak-answer-row { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .ak-badge { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; padding: 4px 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .ak-badge.your  { background: rgba(255,61,87,.15); color: var(--wrong); border: 1px solid var(--wrong); }
  .ak-badge.right { background: rgba(0,230,118,.15); color: var(--correct); border: 1px solid var(--correct); }
  .ak-badge.ok    { background: rgba(0,230,118,.15); color: var(--correct); border: 1px solid var(--correct); }
  .ak-explanation { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

  /* UTILITY */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .q-card { padding: 24px 20px; }
    .result-bars { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .result-card { padding: 40px 24px; }
    .topbar { padding: 12px 16px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ INTRO ═══════════════════════════════════ -->
<div id="intro" class="screen active">
  <div class="badge">Mevzuat Sınavı · EHK 5809</div>
  <div class="hero-title">ELEKTRONİK<br>HABERLEŞME<br>KANUNU</div>
  <div class="hero-sub">5809 Sayılı Kanun Yetkinlik Testi</div>

  <div class="intro-stats">
    <div class="stat-box">
      <span class="stat-num">22</span>
      <span class="stat-label">Soru</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-box">
      <span class="stat-num">6</span>
      <span class="stat-label">Soru Tipi</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-box">
      <span class="stat-num">~35</span>
      <span class="stat-label">Dakika</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <button class="btn-start" onclick="startQuiz()">
    ▶ SINAVI BAŞLAT
  </button>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ QUIZ ════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div id="quiz" class="screen">
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="q-counter">SORU <span id="qNum">1</span>/22</div>
    <div class="progress-bar-wrap">
      <div class="progress-bar-fill" id="progressFill" style="width:5%"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="score-pill" id="scorePill">PUAN: 0 / 0</div>
  </div>

  <div class="q-container">
    <div class="section-header" id="qSection">KESİM I · GENEL HÜKÜMLER</div>
    <div class="q-type-tag" id="qTypeTag">TEK DOĞRU CEVAP</div>

    <div class="q-card" id="qCard">
      <div class="q-number" id="qBigNum">01</div>
      <div class="q-text" id="qText"></div>
      <div class="choices" id="choicesWrap"></div>
      <div class="feedback-box" id="feedbackBox">
        <div class="feedback-title" id="feedbackTitle"></div>
        <div class="feedback-text" id="feedbackText"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button class="btn-next" id="btnNext" onclick="nextQuestion()">
      SONRAKİ SORU →
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ RESULTS ══════════════════════════════════ -->
<div id="results" class="screen">
  <div class="result-card">
    <div class="result-grade" id="resultGrade">0%</div>
    <div class="result-label">Başarı Oranı</div>
    <div class="result-message" id="resultMessage"></div>
    <div class="result-sub" id="resultSub"></div>

    <div class="result-bars">
      <div class="rbar-item">
        <div class="rbar-label">Doğru Cevap</div>
        <div class="rbar-val green" id="rCorrect">0</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rbar-item">
        <div class="rbar-label">Yanlış Cevap</div>
        <div class="rbar-val red" id="rWrong">0</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rbar-item">
        <div class="rbar-label">Toplam Soru</div>
        <div class="rbar-val blue">22</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rbar-item">
        <div class="rbar-label">Net Puan (100 üzerinden)</div>
        <div class="rbar-val gold" id="rNet">0</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button class="btn-retry" onclick="resetQuiz()">↺ TEKRAR ÇÖZ</button>
    <button class="btn-review" onclick="showAnswerKey()">CEVAP ANAHTARI →</button>
  </div>

  <div id="answer-key">
    <div class="ak-title">CEVAP ANAHTARI &amp; ÇÖZÜM AÇIKLAMALARI</div>
    <div id="akContent"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════ DATA ════════════════════════════════════ -->
<script>
const QUESTIONS = [
  /* ─────── 1 ─────── */
  {
    id: 1,
    section: "II. KISIM · ŞEBEKE ÜSTÜ HİZMET YAPTIRIM MEKANİZMASI",
    type: "ANALİTİK / SÜREÇ SIRASI",
    text: "Kurum, düzenlemelerde öngörülen yükümlülükleri yerine getirmeyen veya yetkilendirilmeksizin hizmet sunan bir şebeke üstü hizmet sağlayıcısına idari para cezası uygulamıştır. Bu ceza süresinde ödenmemiştir. Kanun'a göre Kurum'un internet trafiği bant genişliğini daraltabilmesi veya erişimi engelleyebilmesi için <strong>aşağıdaki koşulların hangisi doğru şekilde sıralanmıştır?</strong>",
    choices: [
      "İdari para cezasının uygulanması tek başına yeterlidir; bant daraltma kararı anında verilebilir",
      "Ceza ödenmediği takdirde Kurum derhal, herhangi bir ek süre vermeksizin bant daraltabilir",
      "Ceza süresinde ödenmez VE Kurum'un bildiriminden itibaren altı ay içinde yükümlülükler yerine getirilmez ya da yetkilendirme alınmazsa bant daraltma veya erişim engelleme kararı verilebilir",
      "Ceza ödenmediği takdirde 30 gün içinde yükümlülükler yerine getirilmezse bant daraltılabilir",
      "Bant daraltma kararı ancak mahkeme kararıyla mümkündür; Kurum tek başına bu kararı veremez"
    ],
    correct: 2,
    explanation: "Kanun m.60/17'ye göre iki aşamalı bir koşul öngörülmüştür: (1) önce m.60/16 uyarınca idari para cezası uygulanmalıdır; (2) bu ceza süresinde ödenmez VE Kurum'un bildiriminden itibaren altı ay içinde yükümlülükler yerine getirilmez ya da yetkilendirme alınmazsa — ancak bu iki koşul birlikte gerçekleştiğinde — Kurum internet trafiği bant genişliğinin %95'ine kadar daraltılmasına veya erişimin engellenmesine karar verebilir. Yani ceza kesilmesi tek başına yeterli değildir; ek olarak 6 aylık sürenin de geçmesi gerekir."
  },

  /* ─────── 2 ─────── */
  {
    id: 2,
    section: "I. KISIM · KAPSAM VE İSTİSNALAR",
    type: "OLUMSUZ KÖKLÜ (Hangisi YAPAMAZ?)",
    text: "Aşağıdaki kurumlardan hangisi, <strong>kendi elektronik haberleşme cihaz, sistem ve şebekeleri bakımından</strong> Kanun'un 36. ve 39. maddeler <strong>hariç</strong> tüm hükümlerinden muaf değildir?",
